{
  "id": "48",
  "title": "杂论口诀",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“杂论口诀”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "看子平之法，专论财官；以月上财官为紧要；发觉在于日时，要消详于强弱。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-6b54aa01f9ca48fce8e5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "论官星不论格局。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-8b59437565d2b8a4a696-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "论格局不论官星。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-9ad092cb51878f4f25ff-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "入格者，非富即贵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-4d26bfbbf6615bfd2c82-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "不入格者，非夭即贫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-c09f9b6f90460d23d25a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官怕伤。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-25d02af7d537d960eb04-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财怕劫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-c40bd22fe07df56c58e7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "印綬见财，愈多愈灾。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-1b9f86220e8e3c3fff44-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官见官，为祸百端；若非疾病伤躯，必当官讼囚繫、子丧妻伤。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-37e46d46a51b35854e0e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官见官，元有者重，元无者轻。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-53df77f920a9d2efaa73-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官见官，重则迁徙，轻则刑责。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-b4fe102145ee6abd49e3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官见官，心地勾曲，诡譎多诈，傲物气高；常以天下人不如己；贵人惮之，小人恶之。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-f4a074659fd577a8d242-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官用财者富。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-f3ec8453122310d7d539-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官劫财者贫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-01827a8f6f1efd214463-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "年上伤官，富贵不久。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-3c40cfb64b24c6143343-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "月上伤官，父母不完。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-9f83c111029e4c0b85c5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日上伤官，难为妻妾。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-4186df2c01d01d611ee0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "时上伤官，子孙无传。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-779f22eb95171bb8ac09-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "岁月伤官劫财，生于贫贱之家。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-c5cc01f21f6e8930ddaf-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日下时中有财官，先贫后富。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-3c66165f9f2504df8cf6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "岁月财官印綬，生于富贵之家。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-39fa265fa643f5d655bb-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "故，日时伤官劫财，先富后贫，伤损子息，无晚福。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-f6c53f830a6adbde8c2f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "故，伤官见官、官杀混杂，为人好色多淫，作事小巧寒贱。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-c3816f7a3367491e1c82-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "乙木巳上为太乙，亥上登明；男好色，女淫滥。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-1be72eb5b379dbff9c4e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官杀混杂，有财者吉；无财印者凶。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-7b06fac2b2b8a5f1cdfe-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "但看，财命有气，纵背禄而不贫；财绝命衰，纵建禄而不富。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-19142788e60bfe292a40-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "劫财败财，心高下贱，见者主贪婪。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-de926139d164cb41aee5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "鬼中逢官须逼迫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-5570cc43966de547113e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "彼剋我（官杀）兮贵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-4e073640d046b86cbb74-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "我剋彼（财）兮富。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-96c765f8f194ce35dad0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "彼生我（印）兮以仗母力，长我精神。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-6541eceaaf790546b54e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "我生彼（食伤）兮，常怀逼迫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-655be0a78c6163c7dba1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财入月令，勤俭慳吝。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-1a6cd7ab60dd7d6c81c1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "柱有劫财比刃多者，刑父伤妻，不聚财也。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-b1e59d88b7b220e74fe3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "路伎商贾，须观落地之财。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-e7c5ec283408f37336a0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "宰相须看得时正禄。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-1186989bda9d3a069c03-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "七杀梟重，走遍他乡之客。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-f3a2abeb0195c57dcca1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官劫财，瞒心负赖之徒。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-db02a55b9b94e432101a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "重犯财官者，贵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-8acc468b6c9b244940c2-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "重犯亡神者。夭。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-db06b05f4e6aa939642e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "七杀宜制，独立为强。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-01a7c6e2d88f0c4cbd04-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "明杀合去，五行和气春风。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-356f0728d31bdba87442-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "暗杀合来，刑伤害己。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-c3ff86ac2337f2e33c1b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "时杀喜冲，喜刃无制；女多产厄，男犯刑名。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-a4f05563854b17fbfe84-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "二德无破，女必贤良，男多忠孝。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-40df1af90e71bc60befa-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官用印去财，方可驰名。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-05216dace4261d7da938-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官用财，伤官处须当发福。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-adfd27e4aa7c9252bac2-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "入格清奇者，富。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-ebccfb3194f52b09ff62-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "入格不成者，贫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-46ab1483ffd5c3ae6ae4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "一格二格，非卿即相；三格四格，财官不纯，非隶卒多是九流。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-f0aae11a82f549c43b73-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "六阴朝阳，季月只作印看。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-10d31493ea6ea24e8daa-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "吉神惟怕破害。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-b47b378480ea134c5e81-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "凶神不喜刑冲。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-0460d25ef2718e7a62c6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财官印食，定显慈祥之德。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-8c0b6e8679df4039e44f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官劫刃，难逃寡恶之名。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-e71e2b78701fa2cc0087-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "冲天无合，乃飘流之徒。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-e3dc97cfe2ceee75a930-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "六壬趋艮（寅），逢亥月者贫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-fd2410570df609964a09-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "马落空亡，操心落魄之人。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-aca080e337fcaeea8b6d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "离祖月合、逢冲过房、杀带三刑，母明父暗，多是偷生。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-97fd4d39a4273c835442-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财印偏官，庶出已定。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-8eebc4d8ec1d83859151-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "干头灭烈，冉伯牛怨于苍天。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-1af77c451619e4dc81b8-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "时日冲刑，难免卜商、庄子之叹。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-52ae7d9a3e69ae70b4bd-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "刑多者，为人不义。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-0c4796dfa68d48ca0fbf-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "合多者，疏者亦亲。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-3b007360b30724810bb4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "合多主晦。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-53d03061de3c6d378c03-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "冲多主凶。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-42f208415dfd98fd0444-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "辰多好斗。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-62d466c020461eea7b14-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "戌多好讼。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-c02b8663bbbbb2c85a11-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "辰戌魁罡，多凶少吉。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-24c78df16329b0db2167-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "时日空亡，难为妻子。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-998164a5c0e87df59552-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "交驰驛马，别土离乡。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-73a3224513b4326a2d82-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "食神干旺，胜似财官；顺食者食前方丈，倒食者簞食豆羹。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-abccd46a00267f5019b1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "食衰梟旺，不死也灾。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-fc912a60e18097284977-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "水润下兮，文学显达。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-de916dd0ac730ed976c5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "土稼穡兮，富贵经商。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-efa1b0ba8660a9d21643-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "金水双清而为道。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-3c8ef0bf8abf4bf459ba-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "火土混浊而为僧。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-ba76c0d11fbaa90d029e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "子午最嫌巳亥。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-a14784e7cec03475a04e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "卯酉切忌寅申。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-3e3f0a12fcc115db73f1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "己入亥宫，见阴木终为损寿；时逢丙寅，则冠带簪缨。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-7c81996fc90cf69c07bf-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "五行绝处，即是『胎元』；生日逢之，名曰『受气』。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-d3a61d98120639f9d53a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "化者有十日：甲申、乙酉、庚寅、辛卯、壬午、癸未、丙子、丁丑、戊午、己丑，八字虽不入格，富贵亦是盈餘；另有福德秀气，各有天地神祇。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-0f1bcf2ef17dd7a38cb6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "论化之格，化之真者，名公巨卿；化之假者，孤儿异姓。逢龙即变化，飞龙在天，利见大人。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-1bfd7550f4c1dca1adfe-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "又有冬逢炎热、夏草逢霜、阴鼠栖水、神龟宿火，有合无合，后学难知，得一分三，前贤不载。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-f9bfc7fbf137e1f372d8-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "且夫论格局者，明有定例，撮口诀者，略举一二；当谓诸贤经旨，无合取用，庶可易通。道合无穷，学无止法，经云：『更能绝虑忘思，鑑命无差无误』矣！",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "48-3907c36aad7abfbe0b0a-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "yuanhai-6fbd3c1c68ee5326ccef",
  "version": "ca513874fd5e3ef7467b"
}
